1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://hiski.genealogia.fi/hiski/7fn4qa?fi+0273+vihityt+91, vihitty Lammilla 21.2.1738
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tandefelt_nr_631#TAB_12
