2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Relander,_Lauri_Kristian '''Wikipedia: Lauri Kristian Relander'''] (Finnish: [ˈrelɑnder], Finland Swedish: [reˈlɑnːder]; 31 May 1883 – 9 February 1942) was the second president of Finland (1925–1931
