2 CONT Anna Maria was born 28 July 1745 in Gammelby, Tuusula, Finland[1][2] and lived with her parents in Gammelby gård. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Henrik Johan Justander 23 December 1770 in Tuusula, Finland[4][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria died 6 February 1782 in Sveaborg, Helsinki, Finland[2]
