1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ======================================================================
2 CONT Anna Catharina Cronman I married Franz von Knorring. Please do not merge her with her two nieces of the same name. If you have questions please see the canonical genealogy by Gustaf Magnus Elgenstierna (1871-1948). Gabriel Anrep (
2 CONC 1821-1907) confused Anna Catharina Cronman I and Anna Catharina Cronman III and this was corrected by Gustaf Magnus Elgenstierna (1871-1948) in 1923. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Please note that she has been erroneously merged and then had to be demerged 6 times. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Canonical genealogy: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cronman_family_in_Svenska_adelns_%C3%84ttar-taflor_utgifna_by_Gabriel_Anrep_(1821-1907)_published_in_1850.png#Summary
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Cronman_nr_748
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Katarina Cronman, I was married to von Knorring and she was the daughter of Hans Detterman Cronman Anna Katarina Cronman, II died as a baby and she was the daughter of Joachim Cronman  Anna Katarina Cronman, III was married t
2 CONC o Hans Christoffer von Rohr and she was the daughter of Joachim Cronman (Joachim was the son of Hans Detterman Cronman)
2 CONT
2 CONT (Source: Richard Arthur Norton in 2018)
2 CONT ======================================================================
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Cronman_nr_748
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00650405&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT She is a descendant of King Gustav I of Sweden (Gustav Eriksson Vasa). [Please show us how]
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
