2 CONT 💞 Anni Margit Strömberg (Molander) is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Anni-Margit-Str%C3%B6mberg?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000008268517215 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 13th great grandd
